post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
==> PreAUR runs as the "preaur" user (home /var/lib/preaur).
==> Before enabling preaur.timer:
==>   - add the sudo rules: sudo visudo -f /etc/sudoers.d/preaur
==>     (example: /usr/share/doc/preaur-git/preaur.sudoers.example)
==>   - put your project in /var/lib/preaur/preaur (sudo -iu preaur)
==> An existing "preaur" user is not modified; to move it from /home/preaur,
==> see "Migrating From /home/preaur" in the README.
MSG
}
